---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProsePage from '../components/ui/ProsePage.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Contact TommyTools | Feedback"
	description="Contact TommyTools for product feedback and bug reports. No account required. No contact form is wired yet."
>
	<ProsePage title="Contact">
		<p>
			Feedback helps decide what to fix or build next - especially bugs, unclear results, and
			missing edge cases on a specific tool.
		</p>

		<h2>Feedback method</h2>
		<p>
			There is <strong>no contact form or published inbox wired into this site yet</strong>. When
			a contact email (or other channel) is available, it will be listed on this page.
		</p>
		<p>
			Until then, use this page as the contact entry point from the site footer and navigation.
			Do not send passwords, API keys, or personal document scans through informal channels.
		</p>

		<h2>What is most useful</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Which tool or page you used</li>
			<li>What you expected vs what happened</li>
			<li>Browser and device (for example Chrome on Android)</li>
			<li>Whether any file left your device (if you checked the network panel)</li>
		</ul>

		<p class="note">
			For privacy details that match the current codebase, see <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>.
		</p>
	</ProsePage>
</BaseLayout>
